#: templates/index.html:176
msgid ""
"Biz Toshkent bo‘ylab zamonaviy elektroskuterlar va yetkazib berish uchun "
"qulay sumkalarni ijaraga beramiz."
msgstr ""
"We rent out modern electric scooters and convenient delivery bags across "
"Tashkent."

#: templates/index.html:180
msgid ""
"Tez yetkazib berish, yangi modellar, qulay narxlar va ajoyib xizmat — bizni "
"boshqalardan ajratib turadi."
msgstr ""
"Fast delivery, new models, affordable prices, and excellent service—that’s "
"what sets us apart."

#: templates/index.html:204
msgid "Scooter Collage"
msgstr "Scooters"

#: templates/index.html:207
msgid "Zamonaviy"
msgstr "Modern"

#: templates/index.html:208
msgid "elektroskuterlar"
msgstr "Electric scooters"

#: templates/index.html:211
msgid "Har bir model — shahar uchun. Yengil, tez va ishonchli."
msgstr ""
"Every model is designed for the city: lightweight, fast, and reliable."

#: templates/index.html:218
msgid "Toshkentda"
msgstr "In Tashkent"

#: templates/index.html:232
msgid "Mamnun mijozlar"
msgstr "Satisfied customers"

#: templates/index.html:254
msgid "24/7 qo‘llab-quvvatlash"
msgstr "24/7 support"

#: templates/index.html:273
msgid "Jarayon"
msgstr "The process"

#: templates/index.html:277
msgid "Ariza qoldiring —"
msgstr "Submit a request —"

#: templates/index.html:278
msgid "qolganini biz qilamiz"
msgstr "we’ll handle the rest"

#: templates/index.html:282
msgid ""
"Uch qadam: ariza → aloqa → shartnoma. Hech qanday navbat, hech qanday "
"ortiqcha harakat."
msgstr ""
"Three steps: request → call → contract. No lines, no unnecessary hassle."

#: templates/index.html:296
msgid "Ariza qoldiring"
msgstr "Submit a request —"

#: templates/index.html:297
msgid ""
"Sayt yoki ilova orqali qisqa formani to‘ldiring — 30 soniyadan ko‘p vaqt "
"ketmaydi."
msgstr ""
"Fill out the short form on the website or in the app—it takes less than 30 "
"seconds."

#: templates/index.html:307
msgid "Siz bilan bog‘lanamiz"
msgstr "We’ll contact you"

#: templates/index.html:308
msgid ""
"Operator 5 daqiqa ichida qo‘ng‘iroq qiladi, tafsilotlarni aniqlaydi va qulay"
" vaqtni tanlaydi."
msgstr ""
"An operator will call within 5 minutes to clarify details and arrange a "
"convenient time."

#: templates/index.html:321
msgid "Yetib boring va shartnoma tuzing"
msgstr "Come in and sign the contract"

#: templates/index.html:323
msgid ""
"Biz aytgan manzilga yetib boring va <span class=\"text-brand-yellow font-"
"semibold\">Mustang Shartnoma</span>ni o‘qing. Roziligingizni bildirsangiz — "
"kalitlar sizniki."
msgstr ""
"Visit the specified address and review the Mustang contract. If you agree, "
"the keys are yours."

#: templates/index.html:328 templates/index.html:516
msgid "Mustang Shartnoma"
msgstr "Mustang Taxi"

#: templates/index.html:337 templates/index.html:491
msgid "Ariza qoldirish"
msgstr "Submit a request —"

#: templates/index.html:339
msgid "O‘rtacha javob vaqti — 5 daqiqa"
msgstr "Average response time: 5 minutes"

#: templates/index.html:352
msgid "Shartlar va imtiyozlar"
msgstr "Terms and benefits"

#: templates/index.html:356
msgid "Ariza topshirganingizdan keyin"
msgstr "After submitting your request"

#: templates/index.html:357
msgid "nima olasiz"
msgstr "what you get"

#: templates/index.html:361
msgid ""
"Biz shaffof shartlar va adolatli javobgarlikni taklif qilamiz. Har bir band "
"aniq va tushunarli."
msgstr ""
"We offer transparent terms and fair liability policies. Every clause is "
"clear and easy to understand."

#: templates/index.html:375
msgid "12 soat ish kuni"
msgstr "12-hour workday"

#: templates/index.html:376
msgid ""
"Kuniga 12 soat ishlaysiz — jadval moslashuvchan, lekin barqaror va oldindan "
"ma’lum."
msgstr ""
"You work 12 hours a day; the schedule is flexible yet stable and known in "
"advance."

#: templates/index.html:387
msgid "Birinchi oydan keyin to‘lov"
msgstr "Payment after the first month"

#: templates/index.html:388
msgid "Muvaffaqiyatli birinchi oydan so‘ng biz sizga to‘laymiz:"
msgstr "After a successful first month, we pay you:"

#: templates/index.html:391
msgid "so‘m / oy"
msgstr "soums/month"

#: templates/index.html:393
msgid "Har oy muntazam to‘lov — kechikishlarsiz."
msgstr "Regular monthly payments—no delays."

#: templates/index.html:404
msgid "Ichki nosozlik — bizning zimmamizda"
msgstr "Internal breakdowns—our responsibility"

#: templates/index.html:405
msgid ""
"Mashina ichida biror narsa buzilsa yoki ishdan chiqsa — barcha ta’mirlash "
"ishlarini kompaniya o‘z zimmasiga oladi."
msgstr ""
"If something inside the vehicle breaks or malfunctions, the company covers "
"all repairs. The company covers"

#: templates/index.html:417
msgid "Kompaniya zimmasiga oladi"
msgstr "The company covers"

#: templates/index.html:418
msgid "Ichki nosozliklar va xizmat"
msgstr "Internal breakdowns and servicing"

#: templates/index.html:425
msgid "Dvigatel, akkumulyator va elektronika nosozliklari"
msgstr "Engine, battery, and electronic malfunctions"

#: templates/index.html:429
msgid "Rejali texnik xizmat ko‘rsatish va ehtiyot qismlar"
msgstr "Scheduled maintenance and spare parts"

#: templates/index.html:433
msgid "Yoqilg‘i kartasi va marshrut bo‘yicha ko‘rsatmalar"
msgstr "Fuel card and route instructions"

#: templates/index.html:437
msgid "24/7 qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati"
msgstr "24/7 support service"

#: templates/index.html:441
msgid "Har oylik to‘lov — 8.000.000 so‘m"
msgstr "Monthly payment — 8,000,000 UZS"

#: templates/index.html:452
msgid "Haydovchi javobgar"
msgstr "The driver is responsible for"

#: templates/index.html:453
msgid "Tashqi zarar va baxtsiz hodisalar"
msgstr "External damage and accidents"

#: templates/index.html:460
msgid "Mashinani urib qo‘ysangiz — ta’mirlash sizning hisobingizdan"
msgstr "If you damage the vehicle, repairs are at your expense"

#: templates/index.html:464
msgid "Yo‘l-transport hodisasi (YTH) sodir bo‘lsa — javobgarlik sizda"
msgstr "You are liable in the event of an accident"

#: templates/index.html:468
msgid "Yo‘l harakati qoidalarini buzish oqibatidagi jarimalar"
msgstr "Штрафы за нарушения правил дорожного движения"

#: templates/index.html:472
msgid "Mashinani boshqa shaxsga topshirish — taqiqlangan"
msgstr "Transferring the vehicle to another person is prohibited"

#: templates/index.html:476
msgid "Spirtli ichimlik ta’sirida boshqarish — shartnoma bekor"
msgstr "Driving under the influence results in contract termination"

